===Etymology 2===
[[File:Fish scales.jpg|thumb|Teleost '''scales''' ({{senseno|en|fish}})]]
From {{inh|en|enm|scale}}, from {{der|en|fro|escale}}, from {{der|en|frk|-}} and/or {{der|en|goh|skala}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*skalō}}. Cognate with {{cog|ang|sċealu|t=shell, husk}}, whence the modern doublet {{doublet|notext=1|en|shale}}. Further cognate with {{cog|nl|schaal}}, {{cog|de|Schale}}, {{cog|fr|écale}}.

