===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|zoology}} A horny, [[chitinous]], or bony external plate or scale, as on the shell of a turtle, the skin of crocodiles, or the feet and legs of birds.
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1982|author=w:TC Boyle|title=Water Music|page=71|publisher=Penguin|year_published=2006
|passage=Then one afternoon, as he's stripping the '''scutes''' and hide from a shortnose sturgeon, an idea hits him.}}
